{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壇也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦呪。有身印手印，作印誦呪法即易成。若未入壇，不得輙作。今令誦此呪，即當入壇\n作印行，不成盜法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丁以切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧沒切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "登沒反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦此呪滅一切障，亦能辟魔及除天災。又若誦一遍禮佛一拜，如此日別三時誦呪禮佛，未來當得二相端正具足果\n\n報"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0640004", "type": "mod", "text": "唐【大】，大唐【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0640005", "type": "mod", "text": "一【大】，〔－〕【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0640006", "type": "mod", "text": "聲【大】下同，〔－〕【元】下同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0640007", "type": "mod", "text": "切【大】＊，反【元】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0640008", "type": "mod", "text": "登【大】，下登【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0640003", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】明本，此經麗本缺增上寺宋本缺"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0640004", "type": "orig", "text": "（大）＋唐【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0640005", "type": "orig", "text": "〔一〕－【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0640006", "type": "orig", "text": "〔聲〕－【元】下同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0640007", "type": "orig", "text": "切＝反【元】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0640008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0640008", "type": "orig", "text": "（下）＋登【元】"}
